Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

HostKey /srv/certbaton/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PidFile /run/sshd.pid
AuthorizedKeysFile /srv/certbaton/ssh/authorized_keys

AuthenticationMethods publickey
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitRootLogin no
UsePAM no
StrictModes yes

AllowUsers fixture
DisableForwarding yes
PermitTunnel no
PermitUserEnvironment no
PermitUserRC no
PermitTTY no

MaxAuthTries 3
MaxSessions 4
MaxStartups 4:30:8
LoginGraceTime 20
LogLevel VERBOSE
PrintLastLog no
PrintMotd no

Subsystem sftp internal-sftp -u 0027
